WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:32.333
After hearing the explanation of these verses,

2
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.083
you might be thinking that attaining liberation

3
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:37.041
requires a lot of time,

4
00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:39.041
and this path is difficult.

5
00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:43.041
These thoughts might create
 discouragement in your mind.

6
00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:45.875
But in this verse, Lord Krishna says

7
00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:47.458
that if a person

8
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:50.458
abandons desires and anger
 with complete dedication

9
00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:53.541
and discipline while making continuous efforts,

10
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:57.166
then achieving liberation quickly is possible.

11
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.250
Is the path

12
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.375
to liberation very difficult?

13
00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:11.208
Is freedom from desires and anger impossible?

14
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:12.083
No!

15
00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna

16
00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:18.708
assures that a person who
 conquers desires and anger,

17
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:20.333
and disciplines their thoughts

18
00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:22.625
by embracing self-knowledge,

19
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:24.333
even while still

20
00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:27.083
in a physical body,

21
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:28.666
advances on the path to liberation

22
00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:31.666
in the Supreme.

23
00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.041
Lord Krishna says,

24
00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:35.333
if a person makes efforts in the right direction,

25
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:37.458
this path is not as difficult

26
00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:39.166
as it seems.

27
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.458
A person's desires

28
00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:41.916
and anger create

29
00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:43.833
obstacles on this

30
00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.541
spiritual path.

31
00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:47.541
When desires remain unfulfilled,

32
00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:49.333
a person becomes angry,

33
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:52.250
and this anger confuses the intellect,

34
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.916
making it impossible to distinguish 
between right and wrong.

35
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:57.291
It's like

36
00:01:57.291 --> 00:02:00.708
looking into a polluted river where nothing is clearly visible.

37
00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:01.791
But when a person

38
00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:04.500
controls these emotions,

39
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.666
the mind becomes clear like a calm lake,

40
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:09.708
where the moon

41
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:12.708
of knowledge begins to shine clearly.

42
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:15.583
This mental stability paves the way

43
00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:18.583
for spiritual progress.

44
00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:20.291
Self-knowledge and discipline

45
00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:22.541
hold special importance on this path.

46
00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:24.375
Self-realization means

47
00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:26.291
understanding one's true

48
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:27.750
spiritual nature.

49
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:31.166
A person is not merely a
 physical body and mind,

50
00:02:31.166 --> 00:02:33.625
but a spiritual being.

51
00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:36.875
This understanding is not only intellectual

52
00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:38.875
but is experienced at a deeper level

53
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:40.916
and remains alive.

54
00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:43.333
And discipline means

55
00:02:43.333 --> 00:02:46.416
applying this knowledge in daily life,

56
00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.708
such as controlling the senses,

57
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.541
regulating one's actions,

58
00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:54.541
and making continuous efforts 
toward spiritual perfection.

59
00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:57.208
A person who adopts this discipline

60
00:02:57.208 --> 00:03:00.208
progresses rapidly toward liberation.

61
00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:05.708
Now the question is, when complete
 freedom from desires and anger is difficult,

62
00:03:05.708 --> 00:03:09.583
can it be achieved "in the near future"?

63
00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:11.625
Answering this question,

64
00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:13.041
Lord Krishna

65
00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:15.166
gives assurance to humans.

66
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:16.125
He says

67
00:03:16.125 --> 00:03:20.125
that if a person simply fixes
their mind on the Supreme,

68
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:22.875
the journey to liberation becomes very simple.

69
00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:24.333
Even if a person is currently

70
00:03:24.333 --> 00:03:26.541
far from the Supreme,

71
00:03:26.541 --> 00:03:29.500
if they remember Him with a sincere heart,

72
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.541
He Himself protects them,

73
00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:33.708
removes their difficulties,

74
00:03:33.708 --> 00:03:36.583
and provides proper guidance.

75
00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.791
This means

76
00:03:37.791 --> 00:03:39.083
that no person

77
00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:41.250
is alone on this journey.

78
00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.208
Lord Krishna Himself

79
00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:45.791
is with them as their guide.

80
00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:48.208
When a person becomes 
absorbed in His thoughts

81
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:50.541
and follows His teachings,

82
00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:51.458
even the most

83
00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:54.541
difficult journey becomes pleasant.

84
00:03:54.541 --> 00:03:55.666
A person who keeps their actions

85
00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:58.666
in accordance with Lord Krishna's teachings

86
00:03:58.666 --> 00:04:01.500
and walks on the path shown by Him,

87
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.875
certainly attains liberation.

88
00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:13.750
In life, most people

89
00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.125
find themselves surrounded 
by negative emotions

90
00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:21.083
and material desires.

91
00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:24.583
These distracting forces

92
00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:27.916
confuse us from our goal,

93
00:04:27.916 --> 00:04:31.208
making us agitated and restless.

94
00:04:31.208 --> 00:04:34.291
The Gita teaches you

95
00:04:34.291 --> 00:04:39.583
that if you learn to control your thoughts

96
00:04:39.583 --> 00:04:43.666
and adopt discipline in daily life,

97
00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:45.708
you can attain liberation or

98
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:50.666
your goal quickly.

99
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:54.208
Perhaps this question is now arising

100
00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:57.708
in your mind:

101
00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:01.500
is keeping thoughts under control

102
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.666
really that simple?

103
00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:06.291
No,

104
00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:08.791
it's not easy,

105
00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:11.500
but there is a way.

106
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.250
Just as

107
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.666
daily exercise is necessary

108
00:05:16.666 --> 00:05:20.041
to strengthen the body,

109
00:05:20.041 --> 00:05:23.791
similarly, continuous practice is also necessary

110
00:05:23.791 --> 00:05:27.875
to control the mind.

111
00:05:27.875 --> 00:05:31.500
To develop this discipline of thoughts,

112
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.416
you can begin small practices

113
00:05:34.416 --> 00:05:37.541
in your daily life.

114
00:05:37.541 --> 00:05:40.875
You can incorporate meditation practice

115
00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:42.500
and self-reflection

116
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.291
into your daily routine.

117
00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:47.083
Just as a gardener

118
00:05:47.083 --> 00:05:49.708
continuously cares for his garden

119
00:05:49.708 --> 00:05:53.541
to maintain its beauty, similarly,

120
00:05:53.541 --> 00:05:55.666
you should take care of your thoughts

121
00:05:55.666 --> 00:05:59.541
and emotions.

122
00:05:59.541 --> 00:06:03.458
When you take out a little time each day

123
00:06:03.458 --> 00:06:07.375
to try to understand your thoughts,

124
00:06:07.375 --> 00:06:11.458
your mind gradually becomes calm

125
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:14.833
and stable.

126
00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:18.583
This helps you face life's difficulties

127
00:06:18.583 --> 00:06:20.833
with ease.

128
00:06:20.833 --> 00:06:24.083
Now you might have

129
00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:28.666
this doubt in your mind:

130
00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:32.833
are you alone on this path?

131
00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:34.708
Absolutely not!

132
00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.916
I am with you.

133
00:06:36.916 --> 00:06:40.041
When you perform your actions

134
00:06:40.041 --> 00:06:42.208
according to these teachings,

135
00:06:42.208 --> 00:06:45.541
I will guide you

136
00:06:45.541 --> 00:06:48.833
and nourish you spiritually.

137
00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:51.541
And from this connection with me,

138
00:06:51.541 --> 00:06:54.333
you will gain strength

139
00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:57.083
that will help you walk

140
00:06:57.083 --> 00:06:59.583
this path.

141
00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:07.250
Have you ever thought about

142
00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.208
how a small storm of anger

143
00:07:10.208 --> 00:07:15.666
can devastate your relationships?

144
00:07:15.666 --> 00:07:18.666
When emotions like anger, disappointment,

145
00:07:18.666 --> 00:07:22.875
or impatience arise in a family,

146
00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:27.250
they confuse your thinking,

147
00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.625
and you might speak words

148
00:07:30.625 --> 00:07:34.375
or do things

149
00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:38.750
that can hurt your loved ones.

150
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.708
But what if

151
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:45.791
you learn to control your thoughts

152
00:07:45.791 --> 00:07:47.916
and emotions?

153
00:07:47.916 --> 00:07:52.250
Imagine a common family situation

154
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.541
where disagreement 
arises over something small,

155
00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:58.375
like household chores,

156
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:01.416
differences in child-rearing,

157
00:08:01.416 --> 00:08:05.875
or a casual conversation

158
00:08:05.875 --> 00:08:10.500
that suddenly becomes tense.

159
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:17.166
In such situations, controlling anger or 
frustration becomes difficult

160
00:08:17.166 --> 00:08:21.375
But if you adopt the teachings of the Gita

161
00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:26.291
and practice disciplining your thoughts,

162
00:08:26.291 --> 00:08:29.541
your reaction will change.

163
00:08:29.541 --> 00:08:32.750
You will pause to think

164
00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.541
before responding.

165
00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:37.875
This simple remedy

166
00:08:37.875 --> 00:08:43.416
can change the situation, 
allowing you to respond with patience

167
00:08:43.416 --> 00:08:46.916
and understanding rather than anger.

168
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:50.625
By doing so, you can nurture your family

169
00:08:50.625 --> 00:08:53.708
and social relationships with love

170
00:08:53.708 --> 00:08:58.333
and respect.

171
00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:00.375
Give it a try.

172
00:09:05.166 --> 00:09:08.041
Do you also think that

173
00:09:08.041 --> 00:09:10.250
facing countless struggles

174
00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.041
and failures

175
00:09:12.041 --> 00:09:16.375
is inevitable to achieve success?

176
00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:18.500
In reality, the path to success

177
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.583
is not as difficult and winding

178
00:09:21.583 --> 00:09:24.916
as you might think.

179
00:09:24.916 --> 00:09:26.916
When you discipline your thoughts

180
00:09:26.916 --> 00:09:30.041
and emotions,

181
00:09:30.041 --> 00:09:34.875
you move toward success more rapidly.

182
00:09:34.875 --> 00:09:39.875
When you adopt discipline
 in your professional life,

183
00:09:39.875 --> 00:09:40.708
you not only

184
00:09:40.708 --> 00:09:43.833
improve your productivity

185
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:44.750
but also

186
00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.833
become more focused on your work

187
00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:51.541
and gain greater clarity,

188
00:09:51.541 --> 00:09:56.041
which moves you quickly toward success.

189
00:09:56.041 --> 00:09:58.250
Think about it –

190
00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.583
have you ever become angry at a colleague at your workplace

191
00:10:01.583 --> 00:10:06.708
because work wasn't completed on time or

192
00:10:06.708 --> 00:10:10.583
because of some problem?

193
00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:14.708
Or have you experienced stress?

194
00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:18.416
When these emotions control you,

195
00:10:18.416 --> 00:10:24.458
they blur your decision-making ability.

196
00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:27.708
You cannot use time properly

197
00:10:27.708 --> 00:10:31.833
and you stray from your goals.

198
00:10:31.833 --> 00:10:36.208
But when you discipline your thoughts,

199
00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:38.458
this storm of emotions

200
00:10:38.458 --> 00:10:40.333
cannot create obstacles

201
00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:42.083
in your progress.

202
00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:45.791
This is the discipline

203
00:10:45.791 --> 00:10:49.916
that helps you advance 
toward success in professional life.
